2 CONC  married Louise de Montmorency, daughter of William de Montmorency, Baron de Montmorency, d'Ecouen, Chantilly, & Damville and Anne Pot, on 6 December 1514.1 Gaspard I, Seigneur de Coligny, d'Andelot, & Chatillon sur Loing died on 
