2 CONT ===Summary
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/261573442/claude-antoine_bon_de_meuillon
2 CONT
2 CONT Born before 1568. Claude-Antoine Bon, Lord Baron of Meuillon was also Governor of Marseilles. He married Beatrice on 30 Nov 1600 (-1618). Their son was :
2 CONT
2 CONT François Bon, known as d'Albon, Count of Montbel and Entremont, married Madeleine du Tillet.
