2 CONT Discussion archived at < [https://groups.google.com/g/soc.genealogy.medieval/c/xDeiQixytmQ/m/hDoLfCSwNjkJ groups.google.com/g/soc.genealogy.medieval] >
2 CONT Jan 16, 1999, 1:00:00 AM message from William Addams Reitwiesner
2 CONT https://groups.google.com/g/soc.genealogy.medieval/c/xDeiQixytmQ/m/hDoLfCSwNjkJ
