2 CONC t%20denombrement%20du%2028%20Avril%201665%20de%20la%20baronnie%20de%20Nattage&hl=fr&pg=PA65#v=onepage&q=Reprise%20de%20fief%20et%20denombrement%20du%2028%20Avril%201665%20de%20la%20baronnie%20de%20Nattage&f=false GoogleBooks] >
2 CONT
2 CONT Search for 'Nattage' and under that 'Laurent and Gabriel d'Albon d'Entremont' in italics. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Paraphrased translation of the notation:
2 CONT
2 CONT 'On April 28, 1665, Laurent et Gabriel d'Albon d'Entremont, brothers, recognize to the feudal owner of the efs of Nattage and Saint-André-deBriord that they (the brothers) are holders of these fiefs, parts of which holdings they s
2 CONC hare with their brother, the seigneur Count d'Entremont (FV), and parts of which they inherited in whole (indivise) from their deceased brother and sister, Jean-Pierre and Marguerite d'Albon d'Entremont, and they acknowledge to th
2 CONC e owner their obligations as holders of these noble fiefs'.
2 CONT
2 CONT End of administrator's addition.
