1 NOTE Pedro Fajardo Chacon Manrique de Lara's second marriage was to Inez Manrique. He divorced Ines manrique in 1507 for lack of heirs. He married with Mencia de la Cueva. he lost her to death in 1517. He then married Catalina de Silva
2 CONC  daughter of Juan de Silva and Catalina de Toledo. Married, 1479.
2 CONT Catalina's father was Fernando Alvarez de Toledo married 1460 to Leonor de Zuniga. This is how it came to be that Juan de Zuniga was his uncle.
