1 NOTE YELTES,C13,D.100
2 CONT Facultad real dada por Felipe III Rey de Espana a traves de corregidor de ciudad Rodrigo, (Salamanca),
2 CONT para que su mujer, Juana de Silva Carvajal, mujer de Felix Nieto de Silva, Senor de Alba de Yeltes, puede  emplear cierta cantidad de dinero que tiene subrogado para su mayorazgo en la reparacion de su casa en ciudad Rodrigo..
2 CONT Other genealogists haven't made this marriage connection yet. So this will be the first time that anyone might have seen it. The document above, YELTES, C.13,D.100 supports this connection via the facultad real given by King Felip
2 CONC e III so that Felix Nieto de Silva's WIFE, named as, Juana de Silva Carvajal can use some of the money set aside for her mayorazgo for repairing her home in Rodrigo, Spain.
2 CONT Translation, John Browne Ayes. Research, John Browne Ayes.
2 CONT ES.41168.SNAHN/1.10.1.3.7//YELTES,C.3,D.19
