2 CONT
2 CONT Fue Mariscal de Castilla. Regidor de Zamora. Alcaide de los Reales Alcazares de Zamora. Era tataranieto de los Reyes Alfonso X y Sancho IV de Castilla.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----------
2 CONT
2 CONT -http://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/CASTILE.htm#JuanValenciadied1412B
2 CONT
2 CONT Don '''JUAN de Valencia''', son of FERNANDO Alfonso de Valencia, Señor de Valencia de Campos & his wife dona Maria de Portugal (-[1412]).  He succeeded his father in 1384 as Señor de Valencia de Campos, Oropesa, Mansilla, Baena, P
2 CONC onferrada, Villafranca de Valcárcel, Bembibre, Castroverde, Valderas, Dueñas y Luque.  Marshal of Castile. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' firstly BEATRIZ de Acuña, daughter of MARTÍN III de Acuña Conde de Valencia & his wife Teresa Téllez Girón. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' secondly MARÍA Cabeza de Vaca, daughter of NUÑO Cabeza de Vaca Señor de Arenillas & his wife Catalina de Torres. 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Juan & his first wife had three children: 
2 CONT *1.         DIEGO de Valencia (-[1462]). .. ... ...
2 CONT *2.         ALFONSO Tellez Girón.  Señor de Piqueras.  Caballerizo Mayor of Enrique IV King of Castile. <br> '''m''' BLANCA Pacheco. .. ... ....
2 CONT
2 CONT   Juan & his second wife had two children:
2 CONT *4.         GONZALO de Valencia.
2 CONT *5.         INÉS de Valencia. <br>  '''m''' as his second wife, ENRIQUE de Acuña y Portugal Señor de Villalba del Alcor.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT    Juan had one illegitimate child by an unknown mistress: 
2 CONT *6.          ALONSO de Valencia. 
