1 NAME Kaspar /von Lamberg/ III
2 GIVN Kaspar
2 NSFX III
2 _MARNM von Lamberg
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1492
1 DEAT
2 DATE 27 APR 1548
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00457193&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Kaspar was born in 1492, the son of Georg I, Herr von Lamberg zu Ortenegg, and his second wife Maria Maddalena della Torre. With his first wife Gräfin Anna von Thun he had six children, none of whom had progeny. With his
2 CONC  second wife Margarete Lang von Wellenburg, daughter of Lukas Lang von Wellenburg and Margareta Hofer von Urfarn, he had four children of whom only his son Sigismund would have progeny. 
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1524 Kaspar and his six brothers and cousins were raised to the status of imperial barons, and in 1544 they were made Freiherrn von Orteneck und Ottenstein (in the Waldviertel, Lower Austria). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kaspar died on 27 April 1548
