2 CONT * José Augusto de Sotto Mayor Pizarro , Portuguese Medieval Lineages - 3 vols, Modern University, 1st Edition, Porto, 1999. vol. 2-pg. 370.
2 CONT * Manuel José da Costa Felgueiras Gaio , Furniture of Families of Portugal, Carvalhos de Basto, 2nd Edition, Braga, 1989. vol. IV-pg. 144 (Wedges).
