2 CONT 8. doña URRACA Alfonso ([1225/30]-). m don GARCÍA Gómez Carrillo "él de los Garfios”. Don García earned his nickname following his stand at the siege of Jerez de la Frontera against the Mudejar revolt 31 May 1264 when, as the last
2 CONC  man alive, he was captured by means of grappling hooks on long poles[594]. Alcalde of Jérez de la Frontera.
