2 CONT
2 CONT He married:
2 CONT
2 CONT Margaret of Bourbon (1438-1483) and had 3 children from this marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Louise (1476-1531), married Charles of Valois-Orléans, Count of Angoulême, had children including:
2 CONT
2 CONT Francis I of France whose daughter Margaret of Valois married to Emanuele Filiberto of Savoy.
