2 CONT Extramarital Children
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendants of Oranje and Nassau
2 CONT
2 CONT A human bastard, illegitimate child, illegitimate child or illegitimate child is a child of a father and mother who are not married to each other. An illegitimate child could be married if the parents married after all. People the
2 CONC n spoke of a "mantle child" because the bastard was covered with "the cloak of love". This is with the entry into force of the Nobility Act on 1 August 1994 and the disappearance of the extramarital status in
2 CONT April 1998 no longer possible in the Netherlands. Although there used to be a stigma (especially from a religious angle) on illegitimate children,
2 CONT that was certainly not common.
2 CONT
2 CONT One of the prevailing prejudices was that the bastards, conceived in secret, would also be sly by nature. Especially in the Germanic tribes, and afterwards in the countries that oriented themselves to Germanic law, the bastardism 
2 CONC was a disgrace and bastards were not admitted to many professions. The Catholic Church also adopted the Germanic prejudice and bastards could only become priests with a special dispensation. In France, on the other hand, bastard a
2 CONC ctually became an honorary title. Among others, the Bastard of Orléans and the Grand Bastard of Burgundy became known, while William the Conqueror even referred to himself as William the Bastard even when he was already King of En
2 CONC gland.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * [http://nl.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Nassau_de_Zuylestein_%281645-1709%29 nl.wikipedia...] ; [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/William_Nassau_de_Zuylestein,_1st_Earl_of_Rochford en.wikipedia...] ; 
2 CONT *buitenechtelijke oudste zoon
2 CONT * '''Willem Hendrik van Nassau-Zuijlenstein''', '''William Henry Nassau de Zuylestein'''
2 CONT * Geboren op 7 oktober 1649 - ´s-Gravenhage, ZH, NL
2 CONT *     Overleden op 12 juli 1708 - h. Zuylenstein, Leersum , leeftijd bij overlijden: 58 jaar oud
2 CONT *     Generaal in Statendienst
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Gehuwd===
2 CONT * op 2 juni 1681, Leersum, met Jane Wroth 1659-1703
2 CONT  kinderen
2 CONT === kinderen===
2 CONT * Maria van Nassau 1687-1765.  gehuwd op 18 augustus 1708 met Godard Adriaan van Reede, baron 1674-1730
2 CONT * Henriette van Nassau, Rijksgravin (des H.R.) 1688-1759.  gehuwd op 2 maart 1715 met Frederik Christiaan van Reede, baron 1668-1719
2 CONT ===Titels:===
2 CONT *heer van Zuylenstein, Leersum en Wayenstein, Pair of England, Viscount Tunbridge, earl of Rochford, baron Enfield.
2 CONT *adviseur, vertrouweling en achterneef van koning-stadhouder Willem III. 
2 CONT *Hij was een zoon van Frederik van Nassau en Mary Killigrew.
2 CONT
2 CONT
