1 NOTE Born in Naarden, Holland, Caspar was in America by 1650 when he was witness at a baptism. He also brought suit against Jan Peek but little else is known of his activities although at one time he is said to have served in the Dutch
2 CONC  Navy and lived in England for a time. Another note states that he was a Sgt. for the Dutch West India Company.
2 CONT
2 CONT Known also as Sargaent G MABILLE
