1 NAME Guillaume Gouffier, seigneur de Crèvecoeur
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1488
1 DEAT
2 DATE 24 FEB 1524
2 PLAC (near) Mirabello Castle on theTicino River 
