1 NOTE {geni:about_me}   FRANCISCO  FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO (PEDRO5, JUAN4, PEDRO3, FERNAN2 SANCHEZ-DE-VELASCO, SANCHO1) He married''' MARIA DE MENDOZA, daughter of INIGO LOPEZ-DE-MENDOZA and CATALINA SUAREZ-DE-FIGUEROA.''' She was born 143
2 CONC 0.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for FRANCISCO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO:
2 CONT
2 CONT The 2nd Count of Haro. In 1472 he was made Constable of Castilla, Spain. Source:From the book, Historia Genealogica de las Familias Mas Antiguas de Mexico, by Don Ricardo Ortega y Perez Gallardo.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of FRANCISCO FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO and MARIA DE MENDOZA is:
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. i. BERNARDINO7 FERNANDEZ-DE-VELASCO, d. 1512.
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.somosprimos.com/inclan/velasco.htm
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT María de Mendoza y Figueroa, Condesa de los Molares
2 CONT
2 CONT * c. 1400 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Iñigo López de Mendoza, 1. marqués de Santillana * 19.08.1398  Mother: Catalina Suárez de Figueroa * c. 1400
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriages
2 CONT
2 CONT Per Afan de Ribera y Portocarrero, 1. conde de los Molares * c. 1380 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children •Catalina de Ribera y Mendoza * c. 1420 Pedro Enriquez, señor de Tarifa •Beatriz de Ribera y Mendoza, 2ª condesa de los Molares Pedro Enriquez, señor de Tarifa •Leonor Afan de Ribera y Mendoza * c. 1420 Enrique de Guzman 
2 CONC y Menezes, 2. duque de Medina Sidonia •Inés de Ribera Juan Portocarrero, 2. conde de Medellín
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.geneall.net/H/per_page.php?id=111946
