1 NAME Sigismund /von Lamberg-Ortenegg-Ottenstein/
2 GIVN Sigismund
2 SURN von Lamberg-Ortenegg-Ottenstein
2 _MARNM von Lamberg-Orteneck-Ottenstein
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 28 APR 1536
2 PLAC Schloß Ortenegg
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 7 FEB 1619
2 ADDR
3 CITY Kitzbühel
3 STAE Tirol
3 CTRY Austria
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://genealogics.org/getperson.php?personID=I00025459&tree=LEO
2 CONT
2 CONT BIOGRAPHY Sigismund, Freiherr von Lamberg zu Ortenegg, was born on 28 April 1536, the son of Kaspar III, Freiherr von Lamberg auf Orteneck, and his second wife Margarete Lang von Wellenburg. Like his father he married twice. On 11
2 CONC  October 1558 in Augsburg he married Siguna Eleonore, Freiin Fugger, daughter of Johann Jakob Fugger, Freiherr von Kirchberg und Weissenhorn, and Ursula von Harrach. Of their seven children, Georg Sigismund, Eleonore, Maria Viktor
2 CONC ia and Anna Sibylla would have progeny. Signuna died in 1576. 
2 CONT
2 CONT On 28 April 1579 in Enns, Sigismund married Anna Maria von Meggau, daughter of Ferdinand Helfrich, Freiherr von Meggau, and Ursula Gienger. Of their nine children only Johann Albrecht would have progeny. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigismund died in Kitzbühel on 18 November 1619.
